[{"answer":"Hello, Flanders conference hotel.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, hi. I wanted to ask about conference facilities at the hotel.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Have I come through to the right person?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm... You have. I'm the customer services manager.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/4.mp3"},{"answer":"My name's Angela.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/5.mp3"},{"answer":"So how can I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'm calling from Barrett and Stansons,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/7.mp3"},{"answer":"we're a medical company based in Perth.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/9.mp3"},{"answer":"And we're organising a conference for our clients to be held in Sydney.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/10.mp3"},{"answer":"It'll be held over two days and we're expecting about fifty or sixty people.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/11.mp3"},{"answer":"When were you thinking of having it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Some time early next year, like the end of January?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/13.mp3"},{"answer":"It'd have to be a weekend.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah... let me see...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/15.mp3"},{"answer":"our conference facilities are already booked for the weekend beginning January the 28th.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/16.mp3"},{"answer":"We could do the first weekend in February?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/17.mp3"},{"answer":"How about January the 21st?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh.. I'm afraid that's booked too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, let's go for the February date then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/20.mp3"},{"answer":"So that's the weekend beginning the 4th.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/21.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Now can you tell me a bit about what conference facilities you have?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/24.mp3"},{"answer":"So for talks and presentations we have the Tesla room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Sorry?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Tesla - that's spelled TESLA.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/27.mp3"},{"answer":"it holds up to a hundred people,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/28.mp3"},{"answer":"and it's fully equipped with a projector and so on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/29.mp3"},{"answer":"How about a microphone?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that'll be all set up ready for you,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/31.mp3"},{"answer":"and there'll be one that members of the audience can use too, for questions, if necessary.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/33.mp3"},{"answer":"And we'll also need some sort of open area where people can sit and have a cup of coffee,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/34.mp3"},{"answer":"and we'd like to have an exhibition of our products and services there as well,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/35.mp3"},{"answer":"so that'll need to be quite a big space.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/36.mp3"},{"answer":"That's fine,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/37.mp3"},{"answer":"there's a central atrium with all those facilities,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/38.mp3"},{"answer":"and you can come before the conference starts if you want to set everything up.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/40.mp3"},{"answer":"And I presume there's wifi?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes, that's free and available throughout the hotel.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/42.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Would you also like us to provide a buffet lunch?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/44.mp3"},{"answer":"We can do a two-course meal with a number of different options.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/45.mp3"},{"answer":"What sort of price are we looking at for that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I can send you a copy of the standard menu.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/47.mp3"},{"answer":"That's $45 per person.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Or you can have the special for $25 more.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/49.mp3"},{"answer":"I think the standard should be OK, but yes, send me the menu.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Now we're also going to need accommodation on the Saturday night for some of the participants...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/51.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm not sure how many, but probably about 25.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/52.mp3"},{"answer":"So what do you charge for a room?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, for conference attendees we have a 25% reduction,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/54.mp3"},{"answer":"so we can offer you rooms at $135.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Normally a standard room's $180.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/56.mp3"},{"answer":"And does that include breakfast?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/58.mp3"},{"answer":"And of course, guests can also make use of all the other facilities at the hotel.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/59.mp3"},{"answer":"So we've got a spa where you can get massages and facials and so on,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/60.mp3"},{"answer":"and there's a pool up on the roof for the use of guests.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah... great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Now what about transport links?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/63.mp3"},{"answer":"The hotel's downtown, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it's about 12 kilometres from the airport,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/65.mp3"},{"answer":"but there's a complimentary shuttle bus for guests.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/66.mp3"},{"answer":"And it's only about ten minutes' walk from the central railway station.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/67.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, I don't know Sydney very well,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/69.mp3"},{"answer":"can you just give me an idea of the location of the hotel?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah... well, it's downtown on Wilby Street,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/71.mp3"},{"answer":"ah... that's quite a small street, and it's not very far from the sea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/72.mp3"},{"answer":"And of course if the conference attendees want to go out on the Saturday evening,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/73.mp3"},{"answer":"there's a huge choice of places to eat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Then if they want to make a night of it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/75.mp3"},{"answer":"they can go on to one of the clubs in the area -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/76.mp3"},{"answer":"there are a great many to choose from.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/77.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/78.mp3"},{"answer":"So if we go ahead with this,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/79.mp3"},{"answer":"Can you give me some information about how much...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-14-test-3-part-1-2023-02-02-11-24-59/80.mp3"}]
